  "id": "preview-kickoff-right",
  "title": "PREVIEW — Right kickoff: watch, then learn",
  "description": "Watch the kickoff once, then replay with field thirds, three coaching pauses and fading support runs. LM starts toward goal after RM reaches the ball.",
  "tags": [
    "preview",
    "kickoff",
    "8v8",
    "right",
    "teaching replay"
